      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall look on him the seventh day: and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the plague in his sight is at a stay, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the plague spreadeth not in the skin; then the priest shall shut him up seven days more:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall look on him again the seventh day: and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " somewhat dark, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the plague spreadeth not in the skin, the priest shall pronounce him clean: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a scab: and he shall wash his clothes, and be clean.",
          "kind": "text"
