      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in the seventh day the priest shall look on the scall: and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the scall is not spread in the skin, nor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in sight deeper than the skin; then the priest shall pronounce him clean: and he shall wash his clothes, and be clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if the scall shall spread much in the skin after his cleansing;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the priest shall look on him: and behold, if the scall is spread in the skin, the priest shall not seek for yellow hair; he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if the scall shall be in his sight at a stay, and there is black hair grown in it; the scall is healed, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " clean: and the priest shall pronounce him clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If a man also or a woman shall have in the skin of their flesh bright spots, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " white bright spots;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the priest shall look: and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the bright spots in the skin of their flesh ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " darkish white; it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a freckled spot ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " groweth in the skin; he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the man whose hair hath fallen off his head, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bald; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he that hath his hair fallen off from the part of his head towards his face, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " forehead-bald; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if there is in the bald head, or bald forehead, a white reddish sore; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a leprosy sprung up on his bald head, or his bald forehead.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.43",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.43",
      "verse": 43,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the priest shall look upon it: and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the rising of the sore is white reddish on his bald head, or on his bald forehead, as the leprosy appeareth in the skin of the flesh;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.44",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.44",
      "verse": 44,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He is a leprous man, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean: the priest shall pronounce him utterly unclean; his plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in his head.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.45",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.45",
      "verse": 45,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the leper in whom the plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", his clothes shall be rent, and his head bare, and he shall put a covering upon his upper lip, and shall cry, Unclean, unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.46",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.46",
      "verse": 46,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the days in which the plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in him he shall be defiled; he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean: he shall dwell alone, without the camp ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his habitation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.47",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.47",
      "verse": 47,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The garment also that the plague of leprosy is in, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "whether",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a woolen garment, or a linen garment;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.48",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.48",
      "verse": 48,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whether in the warp, or woof, of linen, or of woolen: whether in a skin, or in any thing made of skin:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.49",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.49",
      "verse": 49,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if the plague is greenish or reddish in the garment, or in the skin, either in the warp, or in the woof, or in any thing of skin: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a plague of leprosy, and shall be shown to the priest:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.50",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.50",
      "verse": 50,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall look upon the plague, and shut up ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that which hath",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the plague seven days:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.51",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.51",
      "verse": 51,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he shall look on the plague on the seventh day: if the plague is spread in the garment, either in the warp, or in the woof, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in a skin, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in any work that is made of skin: the plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fretting leprosy; it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.52",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.52",
      "verse": 52,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall therefore burn that garment, whether warp or woof, in woolen or in linen, or any thing of skin, in which the plague is: for it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fretting leprosy; it shall be burnt in the fire.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.53",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.53",
      "verse": 53,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if the priest shall look, and behold, the plague is not spread in the garment, either in the warp or in the woof, or in any thing of skin;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.54",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.54",
      "verse": 54,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the priest shall command that they wash ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the thing",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in which the plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he shall shut it up seven days more:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.55",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.55",
      "verse": 55,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall look on the plague after it is washed: and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the plague hath not changed its color, and the plague hath not spread; it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean; thou shalt burn it in the fire; it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fret inward, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "whether",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bare within or without.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.56",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.56",
      "verse": 56,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if the priest shall look, and behold, the plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " somewhat dark after the washing of it; then he shall rend it out of the garment, or out of the skin, or out of the warp, or out of the woof:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.57",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.57",
      "verse": 57,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if it shall appear still in the garment, either in the warp, or in the woof, or in any thing of skin; it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a spreading ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "plague",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": thou shalt burn that in which the plague ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", with fire.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.58",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.58",
      "verse": 58,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the garment, either warp, or woof, or whatever thing of skin ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", which thou shalt wash, if the plague hath departed from them, then it shall be washed the second time, and shall be clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.13.59",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.13.59",
      "verse": 59,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the law of the plague of leprosy in a garment of woolen or linen, either in the warp or woof, or any thing of skins, to pronounce it clean, or to pronounce it unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
